  "changes": [
    "Confirmed discard exit in general Settings after save failure; rollback only after all launcher/NFC guards accept the exit; no extra save in the accepted discard kill.",
    "AmiiboDB sorting can leave after confirmed discard even under a permanent save error; its scene exit does not immediately retry the discarded save.",
    "Amiibo AutoUID, AmiiboDB AutoUID/QR and AmiiboLink mode expose consistent Retry/Discard/Back and a separate Yes/No confirmation.",
    "Field-scoped checkpoints retain older pending edits, use verified late settings records for previously clean fields, and follow newer successful saves.",
    "Message boxes keep all actions and confirmation choices readable on the tested 128-pixel layouts, with input accepted only after the fresh frame fence."
  ],
  "existingFeaturesRetained": [
    "Automatic obsolete-group reclamation after durable commit and last-reader release was already implemented in App665.",
    "App666 single-pass collection and its unchanged PackedFS engine remain included; this release adds no new filesystem format or migration.",
    "Existing Chameleon/NFC confirmed discard guards remain in place.",
    "Temporary adaptive mount cache and runtime/boot/power/MTU/UI/menu/build/fault diagnostics already existed in the bound App662 sources.",
    "The App666 fix retaining a valid BLE link after rejected preferred parameters remains included; physical throughput improvement is not measured."
  ],
